        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Mahendran, Prakash Kovelamudi, Mahek Chahal, Kalaipuli S. Dhanu, Devi Sri Prasad\n- Films: Neetho, Sachein\n- Roles: director, actor, actress, model, producer, composer\n- Topics: Telugu cinema, Bollywood films, debut roles, film remake/source material\n\nFacts:\n- Neetho is a 2002 Telugu romance film directed by John Mahendran.\n- Prakash Kovelamudi and Mahek Chahal made their debut roles in the 2002 film Neetho.\n- Mahek Chahal, born on 1 February 1979, is a Norwegian actress and model who appears in Bollywood films.\n- Sachein is based on the earlier Telugu film Neetho from 2002.\n- Kalaipuli S. Dhanu produced Sachein.\n- Devi Sri Prasad composed the score and soundtrack for Sachein.",
